# Q35 How does a catalog row point at a Named KPI, and what must exist first? (the binding property, from a defined data product to a defined measure)
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX dp: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/data-product/>
PREFIX kpi: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/kpi/>
SELECT ?binding ?mustExistFirst WHERE {
  ?binding rdfs:domain dp:DataProduct ; rdfs:range kpi:MeasureDefinition .
  VALUES ?mustExistFirst { dp:DataProduct kpi:MeasureDefinition }
}
